.TH WHATSAPP-DESKTOP 1 "October 2026" "whatsapp-desktop" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
whatsapp-desktop \- desktop client for WhatsApp Web
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B whatsapp-desktop
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ whatsapp://URL ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Loads WhatsApp Web in a dedicated window with system tray integration,
desktop notifications, configurable fonts, themes and privacy controls.
An existing WhatsApp account and an Internet connection are required.
This is an independent client and is not affiliated with Meta or WhatsApp.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --hidden
Start minimized to the system tray.
.TP
.B -v, --version
Print the application version and exit.
.TP
.B -h, --help
Print usage information and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/whatsapp-desktop/whatsapp-desktop.conf
Application preferences. XDG_CONFIG_HOME overrides the configuration root.
.TP
.I ~/.config/whatsapp-desktop/custom.css
Optional user stylesheet, enabled through the application settings.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/whatsapp-desktop/
WhatsApp session and application state. XDG_DATA_HOME overrides the data root.
.SH AUTHOR
Abdallah Shehawey.
